Technology Services University Marketing & Communications Physical Plant & Work Requests Institutional Effectiveness Procurement University Advancement & Alumni Affairs Lander Leadership Board of Trustees President's Office Executive Leadership Academic Affairs Office of Dean of Students The Lander Foundation Center for Faculty Excellence South Carolina Institute on the Prevention of Sexual Violence on College Campuses Faculty Senate Staff Senate Search... Search Search Search Faculty Vacancies Lander Home About Offices & Departments Human Resources Employment Opportunities Current: Faculty Vacancies Employment Opportunities Staff Vacancies Faculty Vacancies Instructions for applying for faculty positions at Lander University are explained at the end of each individual ad. For more information, contact the Office of Academic Affairs. General Vacancies Business & Technology Education Humanities, Arts & Social Sciences Nursing, Human Performance & Health Sciences Science & Mathematics General Vacancies Position Closing Date Part-Time Faculty Teaching Opportunities Until Filled College of Business & Technology Position Closing Date No full time positions available College of Education Position Closing Date Therapeutic Horsemanship Adjunct Until Filled Part-Time University Supervisors of Student Teacher Candidates Until Filled College of Humanities, Arts & Social Sciences Position Closing Date No full time positions available. College of Nursing, Human Performance & Health Sciences Position Closing Date Part-Time Laboratory/Clinical Instructor Until Filled Adjunct Faculty, Exercise Science Until Filled Assistant Professor of Exercise Science Until Filled Adjunct Faculty, Pathophysiology Until Filled College of Science & Mathematics Position Closing Date Science Lab Instructors Until Filled Lecturer or Teaching Assistant Professor of Mathematics Until Filled Visiting Assistant Professor of Environmental Chemistry Until Filled Lecturer or Teaching Assistant Professor of Biology Until Filled Visiting Lecturer/Teaching Assistant Professor of Biology Until Filled About the University Human Resources Employment Opportunities Staff Vacancies Faculty Vacancies Benefits Forms & Resources Faculty Senate Staff Senate Affordable Care Act Americans with Disabilities Act Employee of the Month Fair Labor Standards Act Holiday Schedule Inclement Weather Lander University EPMS System Volunteers Worker's Compensation 320 Stanley Ave, Greenwood, SC 29649 1-888-4LANDER | 864-388-8000 Questions? Contact Us! Lander University Instagram Lander University Facebook Lander University YouTube Lander University Linkedin Lander University X Â© Lander University. Privacy Policy . Clery Report Consumer Information Statement of Non-Discrimination Tucker Hipps Transparency Act Title IX Job Opportunities Report Fraud"
